<view class="container"><view class="title">商品详情</view><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="notice">商城服务暂未启用。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{success}}" class="success">{{success}}</view><button bindtap="reload" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading || !ready}}">刷新商品</button><view wx:if="{{product}}" class="card"><image wx:if="{{product.image}}" src="{{product.image}}" mode="aspectFit" style="width:100%;height:360rpx"/><view class="subtitle">{{product.name}}</view><view class="description">{{product.description || '暂无商品描述'}}</view><picker range="{{product.skus}}" range-key="label" value="{{skuIndex}}" bindchange="sku" disabled="{{loading || pending}}"><view class="field">规格：{{selected.label || '无可选规格'}}（点击选择）</view></picker><view wx:if="{{selected}}">价格 ¥{{selected.price}} · 当前可用库存 {{selected.stock}}</view><label class="field">本次增加数量<input type="number" maxlength="3" value="{{quantity}}" bindinput="quantity" disabled="{{loading || pending}}"/></label><view class="description">加购不锁库存，最终价格、库存和优惠以服务端结算为准。</view><button wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" bindtap="login">登录后加入购物车</button><button wx:else="" type="primary" bindtap="add" disabled="{{loading || !ready || pending || !selected || selected.stock === 0}}">加入购物车</button></view><view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><view>上次加购结果未确认，商品编号{{pending.productId}}，数量{{pending.quantity}}。重试将沿用原内容。</view><button type="primary" bindtap="add" disabled="{{loading || !ready}}">重试原加购请求</button></view><navigator url="/pages/index/index" open-type="reLaunch">去购物车核验 / 结算</navigator><navigator url="/pages/store/index" open-type="reLaunch">返回商品列表</navigator></view>
